IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg6-s251a-agreement`
IMPORT `dg6-s253-parent-subsidiary`

-- Tests of dg6-s253-parent-subsidiary.l4 (8 Del. C. § 253).
-- Every expected value was written by hand from the text (de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, lines 1137-1144) before the file
-- was run. A failing assertion is a finding: no expected value was edited to match the code.

§ `Tests of s 253`

§§ `s 253(a) the 90% condition`

-- A class: votes outstanding, votes owned by a corporation of this State or a foreign corporation, shares entitled to vote.
GIVEN outstanding IS A NUMBER
      owned IS A NUMBER
      votes IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 253(a) Class of the subsidiary's stock`
`test class` outstanding owned votes MEANS
    `s 253(a) Class of the subsidiary's stock` OF outstanding, owned, votes

-- "at least 90%": 90 of 100 is enough, 89 of 100 is not.
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 100 90 TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 100 89 TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 100 100 TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 1000 900 TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 1000 899 TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A class with no outstanding shares that would be entitled to vote is not tested.
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 100 0 FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Counts that cannot be a vote are not covered.
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 100 101 TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the class is owned to at least 90% by the parent` (`test class` 0 0 TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

`a class at 90%` MEANS `test class` 100 90 TRUE
`a class at 89%` MEANS `test class` 100 89 TRUE
`a class that is not a vote` MEANS `test class` 100 101 TRUE

`a subsidiary with its classes` MEANS `s 253(a) Subsidiary corporation` WITH `its certificate of incorporation contains the provision required by s 251(g)(7)(A) and (B)` IS FALSE, `its classes of stock` IS LIST `a class at 90%`, `a class at 90%`
`a subsidiary with a class at 89%` MEANS `s 253(a) Subsidiary corporation` WITH `its certificate of incorporation contains the provision required by s 251(g)(7)(A) and (B)` IS FALSE, `its classes of stock` IS LIST `a class at 90%`, `a class at 89%`
`a subsidiary with the s 251(g)(7) provision` MEANS `s 253(a) Subsidiary corporation` WITH `its certificate of incorporation contains the provision required by s 251(g)(7)(A) and (B)` IS TRUE, `its classes of stock` IS LIST `a class at 90%`
`a subsidiary with no class listed` MEANS `s 253(a) Subsidiary corporation` WITH `its certificate of incorporation contains the provision required by s 251(g)(7)(A) and (B)` IS FALSE, `its classes of stock` IS EMPTY
`a subsidiary with a class that is not a vote` MEANS `s 253(a) Subsidiary corporation` WITH `its certificate of incorporation contains the provision required by s 251(g)(7)(A) and (B)` IS FALSE, `its classes of stock` IS LIST `a class at 90%`, `a class that is not a vote`

-- "each class": every class with voting shares must be at 90%.
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the subsidiary corporation's stock` `a subsidiary with its classes` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the subsidiary corporation's stock` `a subsidiary with a class at 89%` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "other than a corporation which has in its certificate of incorporation the provision required by section 251(g)(7)(A) and (B)"
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the subsidiary corporation's stock` `a subsidiary with the s 251(g)(7) provision` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the subsidiary corporation's stock` `a subsidiary with no class listed` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the subsidiary corporation's stock` `a subsidiary with a class that is not a vote` EQUALS NOTHING

-- "a corporation or corporations": all of them.
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the stock of the subsidiary corporations` (LIST `a subsidiary with its classes`, `a subsidiary with its classes`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the stock of the subsidiary corporations` (LIST `a subsidiary with its classes`, `a subsidiary with a class at 89%`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the stock of the subsidiary corporations` (LIST `a subsidiary with its classes`, `a subsidiary with the s 251(g)(7) provision`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the stock of the subsidiary corporations` (LIST `a subsidiary with its classes`, `a subsidiary with a class that is not a vote`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the parent corporation owns at least 90% of each class of the stock of the subsidiary corporations` EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING

-- The power: the 90% test, one or more of the corporations a corporation of this State, no prohibition in foreign law.
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` (JUST TRUE) 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` (JUST TRUE) 3 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` (JUST TRUE) 0 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` (JUST TRUE) 1 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` (JUST FALSE) 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` NOTHING 1 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the parent corporation may merge the subsidiary corporations under this section` NOTHING 0 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger, the resolution, the parent's stockholders`

-- The certificate: executed per § 103, copy of the resolution, date of adoption, statement for a Delaware parent, statement for a foreign parent.
GIVEN k1 IS A BOOLEAN
      k2 IS A BOOLEAN
      k3 IS A BOOLEAN
      k4 IS A BOOLEAN
      k5 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 253(a) Certificate of ownership and merger`
`test s253 certificate` k1 k2 k3 k4 k5 MEANS
    `s 253(a) Certificate of ownership and merger` OF k1, k2, k3, k4, k5

`parent merges subs into itself` MEANS `the parent corporation merges the subsidiary corporation or corporations into itself and assumes all of its or their obligations`
`parent merges into a sub` MEANS `the parent corporation merges itself, or itself and one or more of the other subsidiary corporations, into one of the subsidiary corporations`

-- Parent survives: nothing about the parent's own approval is stated.
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` TRUE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` TRUE (`test s253 certificate` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` TRUE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` TRUE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- Parent not the survivor: a Delaware parent states the approval of its stockholders; a foreign parent, adoption under its own law.
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` TRUE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` TRUE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` FALSE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the certificate of ownership and merger states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` FALSE (`test s253 certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))

-- The resolution: terms where the parent does not own all the stock; pro rata issuance where the parent is not the survivor.
GIVEN r1 IS A BOOLEAN
      r2 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 253(a) Resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation`
`test resolution` r1 r2 MEANS
    `s 253(a) Resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation` OF r1, r2

#ASSERT `s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` TRUE (`test resolution` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` FALSE (`test resolution` FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges subs into itself` FALSE (`test resolution` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` TRUE (`test resolution` FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` TRUE (`test resolution` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` FALSE (`test resolution` FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the resolution of the board of directors of the parent corporation states what the subsection requires` `parent merges into a sub` FALSE (`test resolution` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 253(a) a term of the resolution may depend on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) a term of the resolution may depend on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` FALSE)

-- The parent's stockholders' vote: a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote.
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the stockholders of the parent corporation approved the merger` `a stock corporation` 51 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the stockholders of the parent corporation approved the merger` `a stock corporation` 50 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the stockholders of the parent corporation approved the merger` `a stock corporation` 101 100 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the stockholders of the parent corporation approved the merger` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` 60 100 EQUALS NOTHING

-- Meeting on 1 March 2026: notice by 9 February 2026 (20 days before).
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the latest date on which notice of the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders may be given` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 2 9
GIVEN meeting IS A DATE
      given IS A DATE
      duly IS A BOOLEAN
      everyone IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 253(a) Notice of the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders`
`test s253 notice` meeting given duly everyone MEANS
    `s 253(a) Notice of the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders` OF meeting, given, duly, everyone

#ASSERT `s 253(a) the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders was held after the notice the subsection requires` (`test s253 notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 2 8) TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders was held after the notice the subsection requires` (`test s253 notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 2 9) TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders was held after the notice the subsection requires` (`test s253 notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 2 10) TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders was held after the notice the subsection requires` (`test s253 notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 2 9) FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a) the meeting of the parent corporation's stockholders was held after the notice the subsection requires` (`test s253 notice` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 2 9) TRUE FALSE))

-- A foreign surviving corporation: section 252(d) or section 258(c) also applies, and the terms must obligate the survivor.
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the section that also applies to the merger` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the section that also applies to the merger` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `section 252(d)`
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(1) the section that also applies to the merger` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `section 258(c)`
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(2) the terms of the merger must obligate the surviving corporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(a)(2) the terms of the merger must obligate the surviving corporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 253(a)(2) the terms of the merger must obligate the surviving corporation` FALSE FALSE

§§ `s 253(b) a change of name`

#ASSERT `s 253(b) the surviving corporation may change its corporate name` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(b) the surviving corporation may change its corporate name` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(b) the surviving corporation may change its corporate name` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(b) the surviving corporation may change its corporate name` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 253(b) the name of the surviving corporation is changed` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(b) the name of the surviving corporation is changed` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(b) the name of the surviving corporation is changed` FALSE TRUE)

§§ `s 253(c) other sections, and appraisal rights`

#ASSERT `s 253(c) s 251(d) applies to the merger` `parent merges subs into itself`
#ASSERT `s 253(c) s 251(d) applies to the merger` `parent merges into a sub`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(c) s 251(e) applies to the merger` `parent merges subs into itself` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 253(c) s 251(e) applies to the merger` `parent merges into a sub` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(c) s 251(e) applies to the merger` `parent merges into a sub` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 253(c) the document that s 251(d) and (e) call the agreement of merger` EQUALS `the resolution of merger adopted by the board of directors of the parent corporation`
#ASSERT `s 253(c) the merger must be accomplished under s 251, s 252, s 257 or s 258` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(c) the merger must be accomplished under s 251, s 252, s 257 or s 258` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 253(c) s 262 applies to the merger` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(c) s 262 applies to the merger` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(c) s 262 applies to the merger` FALSE FALSE)

§§ `s 253(d) appraisal rights`

#ASSERT `s 253(d) the stockholders of the subsidiary have appraisal rights as set forth in s 262` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(d) the stockholders of the subsidiary have appraisal rights as set forth in s 262` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(d) the stockholders of the subsidiary have appraisal rights as set forth in s 262` FALSE FALSE)

§§ `s 253(e) nonstock corporations`

#ASSERT `s 253(e) this section applies to the nonstock corporation` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(e) this section applies to the nonstock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(e) this section applies to the nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(e) this section applies to the nonstock corporation` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(e) this section applies to the nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 253(e) references to the parent corporation's directors and board are read as references to the members of its governing body and to its governing body` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 253(e) references to the parent corporation's directors and board are read as references to the members of its governing body and to its governing body` `a stock corporation` TRUE)

§§ `s 253(f) a charitable nonstock corporation`

#ASSERT `s 253(f) this section authorizes the merger with the corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 253(f) this section authorizes the merger with the corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(f) this section authorizes the merger with the corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 253(f) this section authorizes the merger with the corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 253(a) the sentence defining "facts"`

-- "includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including
-- the corporation": the list is open. An event, and a determination or action by any person or body (the corporation too), are facts;
-- for anything else the text does not say, so the answer is NOTHING (never FALSE).
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the item is a fact within the meaning of the sentence on the resolution` `an event, as the facts sentence of s 251(b) reads` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the item is a fact within the meaning of the sentence on the resolution` `a determination or action by a person or body, including the corporation, as the facts sentence of s 251(b) reads` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 253(a) the item is a fact within the meaning of the sentence on the resolution` `something else, which the facts sentence of s 251(b) neither names nor excludes` EQUALS NOTHING
